{
  // Seasonal perks - BSG "Seasonal Character" mechanic (EFT patch 1.1.0.0).
  //
  // tarkov.dev serves perk metadata at https://json.tarkov.dev/pvp-season/season
  // and its English dictionary at https://json.tarkov.dev/pvp-season/season_en.
  // This supplement retains only raw effects missing from upstream, keyed by
  // the same BSG perk ids. Read names, descriptions, points, exclusions and
  // images from upstream. Perks without meaningful raw effects are omitted.
  //
  // Source: verified in-game (Seasonal Character perk selection screen), refreshed
  // against a 1.1 Seasonal capture and its English locale. Raw item-filter rules
  // are normalized into the existing ItemFilters contract below.
  // Proof: EFT patch 1.1.0.0 notes (Seasonal Character).
  //   https://steamdb.info/patchnotes/24536010/
  // Verified in-game.
  //
  // Fields: id and effects[] (raw in-game effect values). Display descriptions
  // upstream can disagree with raw values: Handyman says crafting time "-50%"
  // while craft_time_multiplicator is 0.87; Polydipsia says "15% faster" while
  // hydration_drain_multiplicator is 1.2. Preserve raw values as captured rather
  // than reconciling them with display text.
  //
  // effects[].itemFilter matches tarkov.dev's served ItemFilters shape:
  // allowedCategories / allowedItems / excludedCategories / excludedItems, each
  // an array of tarkov.dev ids (item template ids for items, item-category node
  // ids for categories). Ids only - names resolve through tarkov.dev's locale
  // system, exactly as tarkov.dev serves item slot/grid filters.

